        "use_own_file": false,
        "active": true,
        "must_read": false,
        "heading": "Product Information",
        "text": "<h2>Product Information</h2><p>Most hair serums never get past the surface. You apply them, you wait, and they sit there while your pillow absorbs half of it. The Micro-Infusion Pro Hair System is built to fix that. Each device is single-use, and uses 0.5mm gold-plated needles, combining the same microneedling technique used in professional in-clinic scalp treatments, to create micro-channels in the scalp and deliver 4ml of serum below the surface, where it can actually reach. The result, with consistent weekly use: visibly fuller, denser-looking hair.</p><p>[icon:hair] Visibly fuller, denser-looking hair</p><p>[icon:micro-stamping] Targets the appearance of thinning areas</p><p>[icon:fast] 5-minute treatment, no downtime</p><p>[icon:needles] Single-use, gold-plated needles infuses serum and delivers below the surface</p><p>[icon:recycled] Each device is made with 80% recycled plastic, certified by the Global Recycled Standard</p><p><strong>What's in the kit</strong></p><ul><li>12 treatments, one treatment a week</li><li>Kits include Hair Renewal Serum (also sold separately): used nightly on non-infusion nights, massaged into and around the scalp.</li></ul><p><strong>Key ingredients:</strong><br/>Six actives, one job: visibly fuller, denser-looking hair. This isn't a serum sitting on your scalp hoping for the best. Pea Sprout Extract, Acetyl Tetrapeptide-3, Clover Flower Extract, Niacinamide, Caffeine and Copper Tripeptide-1, delivered where your scalp can actually use them with the Micro-Infusion Pro.</p>",
        "slides_per_view": ""
      }
    },
