        "heading": "Usage Instructions",
        "text": "<h2>Usage Instructions</h2><p><strong>Weekly Treatment (device):</strong></p><ol><li>Perform your Micro-Infusion Pro Hair treatment once a week, using a fresh, sterile, single-use device each session.</li><li>On the nights between treatments, apply a few drops of Hair Renewal Serum, massaged into and around the scalp.</li></ol><p>[quote_1]</p>",
