        "must_read": false,
        "heading": "Product Claims",
        "text": "<h2>Product Claims</h2><p>Key claims (cosmetic, appearance-based only):</p><ul><li>Helps target the look of thinning, for visibly denser-looking hair</li><li>Supports the appearance of thicker, fuller-looking hair with consistent use</li><li>Single-use, gold-plated needles engineered to work in tandem with the serum to target the appearance of thinning areas</li><li>Sterile, single-use tips ensure a consistent, hygienic experience with every treatment</li><li>Dermatologically tested and suitable for sensitive skin (formula safety and tolerability only)</li></ul><p>[quote_1]</p>",
        "slides_per_view": ""
      }
    },
