          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "style": "blue",
            "text": "<p>If you want to talk about the device sanitation or hygiene versus reusable tools, the only approved phrasing is: “Typically more hygienic than reusable derma rollers, since each tip is sterile and single-use.”</p>"
          }
        }
